{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21899","headline":"除夜酬乐天 · 元稹","name":"除夜酬乐天","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"引傩绥斾乱毵毵，戏罢人归思不堪。\n虚涨火尘龟浦北，无由阿伞凤城南。\n休官期限元同约，除夜情怀老共谙。\n莫道明朝始添岁，今年春在岁前三。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}